        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:VIAtr">VI Atr</ref> 23</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">⁊ ymbren fæstena swa swa sanctus Gregorius Angelcynne sylf hit gedihte.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And the fasts of the Ember Days [shall be observed] as St Gregory himself prescribed for the English nation.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">and ymbrenfæstena, swa swa sanctus Gregorius Angelcynne silf gedihte.</ab>
